<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">You recently requested some information on the Animal Behavior PhD program. Please review this <a href="http://animalbehavior.asu.edu/">useful website</a>; it will provide you with an overview of the program along with detailed information about how to apply.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">To apply for the fall 2017 semester, we must receive your application between <b>October 1 and December 15</b>. Our priority deadline for the fall semester is <b>December 1</b>.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">If you need further information or have any questions, please let me know.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Sincerely,</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><span style="font-size:24.0pt;font-family:&quot;Kunstler Script&quot;;
mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;
mso-no-proof:yes">Wendi Simonson</span></b><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><font color="#990000">Arizona State University</font> | <font color="#ffcc33">School of Life Sciences</font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">SOLS Graduate Programs Coordinator&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">PO Box 874601 | Tempe, AZ 85287-4601</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Phone: 480-965-7490 | Fax: 480-965-7599</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">email: sols.grad@asu.edu</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#CCCCCC">{!Case.Thread_Id}</span><o:p></o:p></p></div>]]></td>
</tr>
